<title>UK: LME PEOPLE - Rudolf Wolff appoints new CEO.</title>
<headline>LME PEOPLE - Rudolf Wolff appoints new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laurent Joly has been appointed managing-director designate of Rudolf Wolff &amp; Co and takes over when Bill Harker retires at the end of 1996, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Joly, already a director of Wolff, comes from the London commodity firm's Canadian natural resources parent Noranda Inc .</p>
<p>Harker will have been head of Wolff for five years. He also retires next month from the board of British regulator Securities and Futures Authority (SFA) on which he has sat for the past year.</p>
<p>London Newsroom +44 171 542 7771</p>
